 "body_html": "<h2>怎麼想</h2><p><b>估算</b>：不用算得很準，先把數變成接近的整十或整百，算出「大約」多少。</p><p>看下一位：48 比較接近 50；312 比較接近 300。<div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 312 56' width='312' height='56' role='img' aria-label='數線'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><line x1='6' y1='16' x2='306' y2='16' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2.5'/><line x1='26' y1='9' x2='26' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='26.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>40</text><line x1='52' y1='9' x2='52' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='78' y1='9' x2='78' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='104' y1='9' x2='104' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='130' y1='9' x2='130' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='156' y1='9' x2='156' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='182' y1='9' x2='182' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='208' y1='9' x2='208' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='234' y1='9' x2='234' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='234.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>48</text><line x1='260' y1='9' x2='260' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='286' y1='9' x2='286' y2='23' stroke='#2b2b2b' stroke-width='2'/><text x='286.0' y='46.0' font-size='18' font-weight='700' fill='#2b2b2b' text-anchor='middle'>50</text></g></svg></div></p><p>估算可以很快判斷錢夠不夠、答案合不合理。</p><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>298 ＋ 405 大約是多少？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>298 大約 300，405 大約 400。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：大約 700</p></div><div class='sn-ex'><span class='sn-ex-t'>例題</span><p class='sn-ex-q'>帶 500 元，買 189 元和 276 元的東西夠嗎？</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>大約 200 ＋ 300 ＝ 500。</p><p class='sn-ex-s'>準確是 465。</p><p class='sn-ex-a'>答：夠</p></div><h2>常見錯誤</h2><div class='sn-tw'><table class='sn-table'><thead><tr><th>常見錯誤</th><th>正確的想法</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>48 估成 40</td><td>48 比較接近 50</td></tr><tr><td>估算後還寫準確的答案</td><td>估算寫「大約」多少</td></tr><tr><td>算完不檢查</td><td>用估算看答案合不合理</td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
